---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Terms & Conditions | Elevate Your Divine"
    description="Terms and conditions for using the Elevate Your Divine website and services."
>
    <Navbar />

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-40 md:pt-30">
        <article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Terms &amp; Conditions
            </h1>

            <br />
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                Last updated: September 19, 2026
            </p>

            <br />

            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                By accessing this website or engaging Elevate Your Divine for
                services, you agree to these Terms &amp; Conditions. These terms
                govern use of the Elevate Your Divine website and services.
            </p>

            <br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Services
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                Elevate Your Divine may provide digital and website services,
                customer experience consulting and assessments, training and
                leadership development, and business experience consulting.
                Specific services, scope, deliverables, and availability may be
                defined in an individual proposal, statement of work, invoice,
                or other project agreement.
            </p>

            <br /><br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Consulting and Recommendations
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                Recommendations are based on the information available during an
                engagement and are intended to support business decisions. Each
                client remains responsible for its decisions, implementation,
                operations, personnel, and customer relationships. Specific
                business, financial, operational, employee, or customer results
                are not guaranteed.
            </p>

            <br /><br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Customer Experience Assessments
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                Customer experience assessments, including secret shopping,
                reflect the conditions and interactions observed during the
                assessment period. Findings may not represent every customer
                interaction, employee, location, or operating condition.
            </p>

            <br /><br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Training and Leadership Development
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                Training and leadership-development services are educational and
                advisory in nature. They do not guarantee employee performance,
                promotion, sales results, or other business outcomes.
            </p>

            <br /><br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Website and Digital Services
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                Clients are responsible for providing accurate and timely
                content, approvals, access, and materials needed for the agreed
                work. Third-party hosting, domains, integrations, plugins, APIs,
                platforms, and other services may have separate terms and may
                change, fail, or discontinue features outside Elevate Your
                Divine's control.
            </p>

            <br /><br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Intellectual Property
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                Ownership and licensing terms for custom deliverables may be
                defined in the applicable project agreement. Elevate Your Divine
                retains its rights in its branding, website content,
                methodologies, and proprietary materials unless otherwise agreed
                in writing.
            </p>

            <br /><br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Payments and Project Agreements
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                Pricing, payment terms, project scope, and deliverables may be
                set out in a proposal, statement of work, invoice, or other
                agreement for a particular consulting engagement or project.
            </p>

            <br /><br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Results and Professional Advice
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                Our services are intended to help identify and improve business
                opportunities and systems. Website performance, customer
                behavior, sales, revenue, employee performance, management
                outcomes, and business growth depend on many factors outside our
                control and are not guaranteed. Business consulting and training
                do not constitute legal, tax, accounting, financial, medical, or
                other licensed professional advice.
            </p>

            <br /><br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Contact
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                Questions about these Terms &amp; Conditions may be sent to
                <a href="mailto:elevateyourdivine@outlook.com">
                    elevateyourdivine@outlook.com
                </a>.
            </p>

            <br />
        </article>
    </main>

    <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
